      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: this hashes a nested ipair through `ipair-comparator`, whose hash recurses into the cdr, so it walks the whole nested ilist. `(comparator-hash ilist-comparator (ilist big))` with a 100,000-element `big` takes 2.3s in a debug build, while `(comparator-hash ilist-comparator big)` takes under 1ms, since SRFI 128\u0027s list comparator stops hashing after 64 elements (and `make-improper-ilist-comparator` here after 128). A loop over the nested ilist with such a bound would stay consistent with `%element\u003d?`.",
      "revId": "b21321c137f028f9a8a2cd138389a987af2fee94",
